## C# Strings

### String methods
```C#
VariableName.Length // return the length of the string
VariableName.ToUpper() // converts string to uppercase
VariableName.ToLower() // converts string to lowercase
string.Concat(a, b) // concate string a and b
VariableName.IndexOf(target) // return the position(index) of first target
``` 

### Special characters
```
\'  ->  single quote
\"  ->  double quote
\\  ->  backslash
\n  ->  new line
\t  ->  tab
\b  ->  backspace
```